# --- On-farm culture CM trial I (21854917)
("21854917", "researcher", 0, "reduced intramammary antibiotic use by half and tended to decrease milk withholding time by 1 d",
 ("In a US-Canada trial, what did on-farm culture-guided treatment of mild/moderate clinical mastitis achieve?", ["Halved intramammary antibiotic use", "Raised bacteriological cure to 95%", "Eliminated milk discard entirely", "Doubled days to clinical cure"],
  "Antibiotic use fell by half and milk withholding tended to drop by a day, with similar short-term outcomes.", "Halved antibiotic use."),
 ("En un ensayo de EE. UU. y Canadá, ¿qué logró tratar la mastitis clínica leve/moderada guiándose por cultivo en el tambo?", ["Redujo a la mitad el antibiótico", "Subió la cura bacteriológica al 95%", "Eliminó todo descarte de leche", "Duplicó los días a cura clínica"],
  "El uso de antibiótico cayó a la mitad y el descarte de leche tendió a bajar un día, con resultados similares.", "Mitad de antibiótico.")),
("21854917", "curious", 1, "Quarters with gram-negative or no growth did not receive intramammary therapy",
 ("In the on-farm culture program, which clinical mastitis quarters received no intramammary therapy?", ["Gram-positive growth", "Gram-negative or no growth", "Mixed infections", "All quarters were treated"],
  "Only gram-positive or mixed growth was treated with cephapirin; gram-negative or no-growth cases were not.", "Gram-negative or none."),
 ("En el programa de cultivo en el tambo, ¿qué cuartos con mastitis clínica no recibieron terapia intramamaria?", ["Con crecimiento grampositivo", "Gramnegativos o sin crecimiento", "Con infecciones mixtas", "Todos los cuartos fueron tratados"],
  "Solo se trató con cefapirina el crecimiento grampositivo o mixto; los gramnegativos o sin crecimiento no.", "Gramnegativos o nada.")),

# --- On-farm culture CM trial II (21854918)
