 ("What were the long-term effects of selective, on-farm culture-based clinical mastitis treatment for the rest of lactation?", ["Much higher culling rate", "Lower milk production", "No differences found", "More recurrent cases"],
  "Recurrence, SCC, milk yield and survival did not differ from immediate cephapirin treatment.", "No differences."),
