# --- Cost-effectiveness of OFC (28903881)
("28903881", "expert", 3, "not those in which Gram-positive pathogens were responsible for more than 20% of all clinical cases",
 ("A UK Monte Carlo model found on-farm culture before clinical mastitis treatment probably not cost-effective in which herds?", ["Herds with mostly coliform cases", "Herds with very low case numbers", "Herds with high milk prices only", "Herds with >20% gram-positive cases"],
  "When gram-positives exceed 20% of cases, delayed treatment and reduced cure likely outweigh the savings.", ">20% gram-positive."),
 ("Un modelo Monte Carlo británico halló que el cultivo en el tambo antes de tratar probablemente no es rentable en qué tambos?", ["Con casos mayormente coliformes", "Con muy pocos casos al año", "Solo con precios de leche altos", "Con >20% de casos grampositivos"],
  "Si los grampositivos superan el 20% de los casos, la demora y menor cura superarían el ahorro.", ">20% grampositivos.")),
("28903881", "researcher", 0, "The results highlight an ethical dilemma surrounding reduced use of antimicrobials for clinical mastitis",
 ("What dilemma did the UK cost-effectiveness study of on-farm culture highlight?", ["Less antibiotic vs losses and welfare", "Lab culture vs vaccine use", "Organic vs conventional milk prices", "Teat dipping vs teat sealants"],
  "Cutting antimicrobial use may bring financial losses and poorer cow welfare in many cases.", "Less antibiotic vs welfare."),
 ("¿Qué dilema destacó el estudio británico de costo-efectividad del cultivo en el tambo?", ["Menos antibiótico vs pérdidas y bienestar", "Cultivo de laboratorio vs vacunas", "Precio de leche orgánica vs convencional", "Sellado externo vs sellador interno"],
  "Reducir antimicrobianos puede traer pérdidas económicas y peor bienestar de las vacas en muchos casos.", "Menos antibiótico vs bienestar.")),

